 \sup_{\substack{\Theta\in\mathbb R\\|\zeta|\leq L^{C_4}}}
       \|\mathcal T_\zeta(\Theta)\|_{2\to2}
       \leq L^{-E_{\rm id}}.$$ The family is independent of the individual values of $\Theta,\zeta$, and all its defining parameters are independent of $J$.*



